(The i3 desktop uses solid graphite and orange styling, rounded controls, a top) Tj
T*
/F1 9.5 Tf 0.13 0.15 0.18 rg
(music/window bar, and a centered opaque dock with running dots, click-to-restore apps,) Tj
T*
/F1 9.5 Tf 0.13 0.15 0.18 rg
(and right-click window actions.) Tj
T*
/F1 9.5 Tf 0.13 0.15 0.18 rg
(Core 0.9.9 includes matching native icons, focus-neutral dock previews, responsive) Tj
T*
/F1 9.5 Tf 0.13 0.15 0.18 rg
(panel spacing, AI loading/RAM/storage indicators, and larger third-party controls that) Tj
T*
/F1 9.5 Tf 0.13 0.15 0.18 rg
